boarding-teleport-instructions = [head=2]Bluespace boarding teleport[/head]
    
    1. Unpack the console, bluespace engine, four platforms, and four remotes on the same grid.
    2. The engine auto-links to the console and sets jump range and lock speed limits.
    3. Use a multitool to add the platforms to the console device list.
    4. In multitool link mode, link each remote to its platform.
    5. Open the console: hover the enemy shuttle on the large map and click it.
    6. On the next page, click a tile on the selected grid map. This is the landing point.
    7. Stand on a platform and press its linked remote. One person is sent; the platform recharges for 30 seconds.
    8. Press the same remote again within five minutes to return to your platform. The target is re-checked before each jump.

